Subject: contracts: the fabric.* RPC group, settings flags and conversation import fields

rpc.ts carries the Baton Rpc definitions (D71 keeps the fabric.* names on the wire); settings and
environment add Baton's flags and capabilities; agentSessions adds import and presence fields.

